<section class="sbs-panel sbs-tools" data-panel="fix" id="sbs-fix" aria-label="Fix selected artwork">
 <div class="sbs-tools-inputs"><label class="sbs-button">Browse tablet artwork<input id="sbs-fix-file" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp"></label><div><label>Saved Studio workspace<select id="sbs-fix-source"><option value="">Choose workspace image</option></select></label><button id="sbs-fix-refresh" class="sbs-button">Refresh workspaces</button></div></div>
 <div class="sbs-tool-row"><label>Select area<select id="sbs-fix-tool"><option value="brush">Brush — add</option><option value="erase">Brush — erase</option><option value="smart">Smart connected colour — add</option><option value="pan">Pan view</option></select></label><label>Brush size<input id="sbs-fix-size" type="range" min="1" max="160" value="30"></label><button id="sbs-fix-undo" class="sbs-button">Undo selection</button><button id="sbs-fix-clear" class="sbs-button">Clear selection</button><label>Zoom<input id="sbs-fix-zoom" type="range" min="1" max="8" step="0.1" value="1"></label><label>Backdrop<select id="sbs-fix-backdrop"><option value="#363636">Dark</option><option value="#eeeeee">Light</option><option value="#2674ab">Blue</option></select></label></div>
 <div class="sbs-tool-row"><label>Mode<select id="sbs-fix-mode"><option value="remove">Remove &amp; blend background</option><option value="replace">Replace with…</option></select></label><label id="sbs-fix-replace-label" hidden>Replace with<input id="sbs-fix-replacement" type="text" maxlength="500"></label><label><input id="sbs-fix-cost" type="checkbox">Use paid AI repair (provider usage charges apply)</label><button id="sbs-fix-run" class="sbs-button primary">Fix selected area</button><button id="sbs-fix-resume" class="sbs-button" hidden>Resume repair</button></div>
 <p id="sbs-fix-status" class="sbs-result" role="status" aria-live="polite">Load artwork, mark the unwanted item, then Fix selected area. The red selection is the exact edit boundary; no hidden feather margin. Smart selection follows connected colour; check its boundary before paying for a repair.</p>
 <div class="sbs-tool-view" id="sbs-fix-view"><canvas id="sbs-fix-canvas" width="800" height="800" aria-label="Repair selection; paint only the area allowed to change"></canvas></div>
 <div class="sbs-tool-row"><button id="sbs-fix-before" class="sbs-button" aria-pressed="true">Before</button><button id="sbs-fix-preview" class="sbs-button" aria-pressed="false">Preview</button><button id="sbs-fix-focus" class="sbs-button">View repaired area</button><button id="sbs-fix-improve" class="sbs-button">Improve selection</button><label><input id="sbs-fix-boundary" type="checkbox" checked>Show selection boundary</label><button id="sbs-fix-retry" class="sbs-button">Try again</button><button id="sbs-fix-cancel" class="sbs-button">Cancel preview</button></div>
 <label class="sbs-quality-confirm"><input id="sbs-fix-reviewed" type="checkbox">I reviewed Before and Preview in the marked area.</label>
 <label id="sbs-fix-override-label" class="sbs-quality-confirm" hidden><input id="sbs-fix-override" type="checkbox">The quality check is uncertain or failed. I still want to save this unapproved candidate.</label>
 <div class="sbs-tool-row"><label>Artwork name<input id="sbs-fix-title" type="text" maxlength="150" placeholder="Artwork name"></label><label>Series<select id="sbs-fix-series"><option value="SB">Smutty Bear</option><option value="MB">Madam Butterfly</option><option value="TT">Torsotopia</option><option value="PW">Piston Works</option></select></label><button id="sbs-fix-save" class="sbs-button primary">Accept &amp; Save New Version</button><button id="sbs-fix-continue" class="sbs-button" hidden>Continue in Finishing</button></div>

 <p>Originals remain saved. Before and Preview use the same zoom and position. Accept saves an unapproved candidate in Finishing; the original remains available there.</p>
</section>
